  "summary": "I am passionate about building highly scalable, interactive web sites. Through my experience as a Senior Web Developer, I have acquired strong foundation and experience in technologies for delivering web pages including PHP, HTML, CSS, J-Query, and Java frameworks.\n\nI lead a team for development initiatives for our sites.\n\nProject Planning \n\nI am responsible for the architecture and technical solution for a project. I am required to come up with a full implementation plan based on best design pattern, and latest technologies, applicable to solving a problem. I am also responsible for implementing responsive web design for mobile devices.\n\nProject Coordination\n\nI work closely with a team composed of project managers, engineers, and programmers to implement changes and improve performance against targets. I am also responsible for implementing appropriate test cases and code documentation.\n\nWebsite Support\n\nI provide required development or operational support to ensure excellent website performance and stability.\n\nI love cooking Italian dishes and desserts. I enjoy diving, running, and hiking. I also find blogging a very fulfilling hobby. I have been writing some blogs about Cloud Computing and Latest Web Trends.  You may check out my blogs in the links below.",
